<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - June 11.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - June 11.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- The Mozambican government has announced that the country's first multiparty municipal elections will be held on December 27.</p>
<p>- The German government has formally agreed to write off $68.3 million of Mozambique's debt to Germany. The remaining $42.2 million is to be repaid over 23 years.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
